From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 19:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: mfd: syscon: Add the S5L8960X i2s-switch

The A7's i2s-switch (Apple's i2s-switch,s5l8960x) is the routing block
the A9 and A8X MCA drivers program as a syscon; on the iPad Air, MCA0
reaches the codec's pad through it.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/syscon.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/syscon.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/syscon.yaml
index 6ce14ebaf..98f42ea86 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/syscon.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/syscon.yaml
@@ -46,6 +46,7 @@ properties:
               - apm,xgene-mcb
               - apm,xgene-rb
               - apm,xgene-scu
+              - apple,s5l8960x-i2s-switch
               - apple,s8000-i2s-switch
               - apple,t7001-i2s-switch
               - apple,t8010-aop-i2s-oe
-- 
2.56.0

